        "titleEn": "Battery level"
      },
      {
        "title": "冷冻库说明",
        "titleEn": "Freezer overview",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "适用于 -18℃ 冷冻库。温度上限、下限、开门时长、传感器与网关离线均可触发告警。",
        "textEn": "Designed for -18°C freezer rooms. Alarms cover high/low temperature, door timeout, sensor fault and gateway offline."
      }
